    "text": "<p>In the given figure, the block of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math> is dropped from the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#39;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></math>. The expression for kinetic energy of block when it reaches point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#39;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></math>&nbsp;is</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/8f913b10-c535-4741-9267-58d87bcd1941-image.png\" style=\"width: 130px; height: 220px;\" /></p>",
